Side UInt 46 1 # OrderDetails: 1 buy, 2 sell (ofs 48)
OrdType UInt 47 1 # OrderDetails: 1 market order; cash only (ofs 49)
HHIIndicator SInt 48 1 # OrderDetails: HHI if the level still exists; -1 no update (ofs 50)
Pad5 Pad 49 5 # OrderDetails: not used (ofs 51)
Price PriceType 54 8 # OrderDetails: former price, optional (ofs 56)

MessageType 13103 0 2 # OrderMassDelete: the instrument's order book is emptied (p.66, 8.4)
@size 22
