Pad6 Pad 48 6 # not used (ofs 50)

MessageType 13300 0 2 # ProductStateChange: product trading state; not sent for IPS products (p.75-76, 8.5; p.19, 4.9)
@size 22
MsgSeqNum UInt 2 4 # per product (ofs 4)
TradingSessionID UInt 6 1 # 1 day, 3 morning, 5 evening, 6 after hours, 7 holiday (ofs 8)
TradingSessionSubID UInt 7 1 # 1 pre trading, 3 continuous, 4 closing, 5 post trading, 7 quiescent, 10 out of main session (ofs 9)
TradSesStatus UInt 8 1 # 1 halted, 2 open, 3 closed (ofs 10)
