FastMarketIndicator UInt 10 1 # 0 no, 1 yes (ofs 12)
TESTradSesStatus UInt 11 1 # 1 halted, 2 open, 3 closed, 5 pre close (ofs 13)
Pad2 Pad 12 2 # not used (ofs 14)
TransactTime UTCTimestamp 14 8 # transaction time (ofs 16)

MessageType 13302 0 2 # MassInstrumentStateChange: state of all instruments of one type in a product, with an exception list; NoRelatedSym SecMassStat follow (p.77-82, 8.5)
@size 30
MsgSeqNum UInt 2 4 # per product (ofs 4)
