TransactTime UTCTimestamp 14 8 # transaction time (ofs 16)
LastFragment UInt 22 1 # 0 N, 1 Y: exception lists of fragments up to Y are joined before applying (ofs 24)
NoRelatedSym Counter 23 1 # entries in SecMassStatGrp, 0..24 (ofs 25)
Pad6 Pad 24 6 # not used (ofs 26)
SecMassStatGrp Group 30 # NoRelatedSym x grp::SecMassStat (32 bytes each) (ofs 32)

